  "author": "Центр медиакоммуникаций",
  "excerpt": "Соревнования среди студентов медицинских и фармацевтических вузов России состоялись в конце сентября в Казани. Участие приняли четыре команды - обучающиеся факультетов иностранных студентов. Победу одержали…",
  "body_html": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">Соревнования среди студентов медицинских и фармацевтических вузов России состоялись в конце сентября в Казани. Участие приняли четыре команды</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"> - обучающиеся факультетов иностранных студентов.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">Победу одержали представители&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">Перв</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">ого</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"> <span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">Московс</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">кого</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"> <span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">государственн</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">ого</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"> <span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">медицинск</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">ого</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"> <span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">университет</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">а</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"> <span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">имени И.М. Сеченова</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"> <span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">Второе место заняла команда Башкирского медицинского университета. Студенты ОрГМУ замыкают тройку призеров. </span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">Казанский государственный медицинский университет показал достойную игру, но уступил соперникам.</span></p>",
